---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const headshotUrl = "/eric%202026%20headshot.png";
---

<Base title="About - Eric">
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="page-container-narrow">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-start">
        <img
          src={headshotUrl}
          alt="Eric Martin"
          width="400"
          height="500"
          class="mx-auto aspect-[4/5] w-full max-w-[200px] shrink-0 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-panel object-cover shadow-[0_12px_30px_rgba(15,23,42,0.1)] sm:mx-0 sm:max-w-[220px]"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
          <p class="eyebrow mb-2">Revenue &amp; strategic operations · AI enablement</p>
          <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">About</h1>
          <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-muted">
            I care about the infrastructure that connects pipeline, planning,
            execution, and reporting — and about adding AI and automation where they
            actually help, without wrecking adoption. Growth-stage and
            customer-facing work, where BD, workflow design, and systems thinking have
            to stay in sync.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-muted">
            Outside of work, I have been with my fiancée for over five years, we
            have a two-year-old son, two dogs, a cat, and a ferret. I spend my time
            making and playing music, running, and being with my family.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="surface p-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">How I work</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-muted">
            <li>Anchor on business signal — not tool flavor-of-the-month</li>
            <li>Make handoffs explicit before scaling headcount</li>
            <li>Ship internal systems that teams can actually run</li>
            <li>Stay in the loop through implementation, not just kickoff</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="surface p-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">What I value</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-muted">
            <li>Clarity over complexity</li>
            <li>Execution over theater</li>
            <li>Durable systems over quick fixes</li>
            <li>Ownership over handoffs</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="surface-muted mt-8 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Where I fit</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
          Environments where revenue motion, field execution, and leadership reporting
          all need to match — and someone needs to build the glue. I do best when
          accountability and speed both matter.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
